 "text", "content": "Instructions: \n<span class=\"bullet\">Proofread the sentence.</span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Click on the incorrect expressions.</span> \n<span class=\"bullet\">Type in the correct expression to complete the sentence.\n</span> <span class=\"bullet\">Use capital letters where necessary.</span>"}]}, {"type": "template_override", "content": 2}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "RSLT", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 0, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}, {"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 1}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 10, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": []}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Quiz"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}]}, {"stimuli_ids": [], "type": "DWS", "questions": [{"responses": [{"correct": 1, "_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "selected": 0, "id": 0}], "id": 0, "_data": [{"type": "question", "contents": [{"type": "pdf", "content": "engenn9le03ob09re7pdf01.pdf"}]}]}], "template_override": 1, "id": 11, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Practice a mock informational interview. "}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"type": "group_name", "content": "Take Away"}]}, {"type": "feedback", "content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}, {"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"type": "text", "content": "Whoops! Something important is missing."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Maybe next time..."}]}}, {"type": "learning_skills", "contents": [{"type": "skill", "content": "Reading"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Writing"}, {"type": "skill", "content": "Speaking"}]}, {"type": "post_instructions", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}]}], "type": "scholar", "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"type": "has_nav", "content": true}, {"type": "has_exercise_controls", "content": true}]}], "id": 0, "stimuli": [{"type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "_data": [], "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"coverimg": "engenn9le03ob09re2img06.jpg", "audiosrc": "engenn9le03ob09re2aud01", "images": [{"time": "0", "image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"time": "100", "image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Hello, Ms. Wilkinson. Thank you for agreeing to speak with me. I really think I could benefit from your expertise.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: You're welcome. I know when I was first breaking into the field, I took any advice I could get.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I couldn't agree more. I really do appreciate having the opportunity to pick your brain.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Any time. Based on your education I'd say you're already on the right track. Did you join any organizations at Harvard, or were you too busy studying?", "id": 1}, {"time": "31000", "image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: The course load was heavy, of course, but I was writing for the <span class=\"italic\">Harvard Lampoon</span> in between classes and assignments.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Good. In your e-mail you mentioned that you were copy editing and that you were publishing content for social media. Is that correct?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: That's correct. On top of that, I was also working with the CEO to develop an offline marketing campaign. I really want to build up my skill set.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: That's great, and there's certainly nothing wrong with learning new skills, but there's something to be said for gaining an in-depth knowledge of one particular area.", "id": 2}, {"time": "67000", "image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I see what you're saying. I guess the cost of being a jack of all trades is that you're a  master of none.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Exactly. Take me, for example. When I was starting out at WXBJ, I focused on coordinating and scheduling. Sure, I dabbled in talent booking, but I kept my eyes on the main goal.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I see. So I should spend my efforts developing the skills I hope to use most in the future?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Exactly.\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Great advice. I'm so glad I met with you!\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: Me too.", "id": 3}, {"time": "101000", "image": "engenn9le03ob09re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Who else would you recommend I speak with?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Danielle</span>: There are a few people I would recommend. Why don't I send you an e-mail tomorrow with their names and contact information?\n<br><span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: That would be great! Thank you!", "id": 4}]}}], "template_override": 1, "title": "", "type": "audio", "id": 1, "_data": []}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "The World of Work"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "The Interview"}, {"type": "position", "content": 9}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 3}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Identify and describe jobs and careers in both work and social contexts appropriate for the interlocutor."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Integrates a wider range of written and spoken language skills and knowledge when dealing with problems and difficulties in the workplace."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Simple Past and The Past Continuous Tenses"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you are in an interview, it is common to use a mixture of tenses. They allow you to convey a variety of timelines and action sequences. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the <span class=\"strong\">Simple Past </span> tense to talk about many kinds of past events: short, quickly finished actions, longer situations and repeated events."}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use the<span class=\"strong\"> Past Continuous</span> tense to talk ..."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>about<span class=\"strong\"> two </span>actions in the past; one continues for a period, and the other starts and ends (simple past).</li></ul><br>For example: <span class=\"italic\"><span class=\"strong\">When</span> I <span class=\"underline\">was first getting started </span>in the broadcast industry, I <span class=\"underline\">talked </span> to many different people."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>about two actions in the past, both happening over a period.</li></ul><br>For example: <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"underline\">was studying </span>and I <span class=\"underline\">was working </span>in retail."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ul><li>about a temporary activity taking place over a limited time</li></ul><br>For example: <span class=\"italic\">I <span class=\"underline\">was writing </span>for them during the semester."}, {"type": "text", "content": "The form of the <span class=\"strong\">Past Continuous</span> is:<br><span class=\"italic\">subject + was/were + verb-ing"}, {"type": "text", "content": "NOTE: When you want to ask a question using the<span class=\"strong\"> Past Continuous</span>, the form changes. <br><span class=\"italic\">Was/were + subject + verb-ing \u2026 ? <br><br/>For example:  <br><span class=\"italic\">Were you busy studying for your tests?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Informational Interview Etiquette"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "Here are some tips about what you should do in an informational interview. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li value=\"1\"><span class=\"strong\"> Act as though it is an actual interview.</span><span class=\"italic\"> Be on time and dress like you would for an interview. </li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol> <li value=\"2\"><span class=\"strong\">Prepare 5 to 10 thoughtful questions.</span><span class=\"italic\"> Ask questions about the interviewer's career path and the skills they think are important. Find out what they enjoy in the position and what they find challenging. Get their advice.</li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li value=\"3\"><span class=\"strong\">Be agreeable. </span><span class=\"italic\">Even if you disagree with your interviewer's advice, graciously accept it. </li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li value=\"4\"><span class=\"strong\">Ask your interviewer whether you can take notes.</span> <span class=\"italic\">If he or she agrees, do so. By taking notes, you show that you are listening to what the interviewer is saying. </li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li value=\"5\"><span class=\"strong\">Ask your interviewer for names.</span> <span class=\"italic\">Ask them to make a recommendation of others you can meet, write them down and ask if you can use his or her name when contacting them.</li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li value=\"6\"><span class=\"strong\">Be respectful of your interviewer's time and busy schedule. </span><span class=\"italic\">Keep the meeting to 30 minutes, unless he or she indicates a willingness to extend your time together.</li></ol>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<ol><li value=\"7\"><span class=\"strong\">Show gratitude at the beginning and the end. </span><span class=\"italic\">An informational interview is an act of kindness, and you can never thank somebody enough.</li></ol>"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "expertise "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "knowledge in a particular subject, that you learn by experience "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example:  I really think I could benefit from your expertise."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob09aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you may hear in an informational interview."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to pick your brain "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "obtain information by questioning someone who is better informed about a subject than yourself "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I really do appreciate having the opportunity to pick your brain."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob09aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "on the right track "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "acting in a way where you are likely to achieve the results you want "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I'd say you're already on the right track. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob09aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to coordinate "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to organize an activity so that the people involved in it work well together  "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When I was starting out at WXBJ, I focused on coordinating and scheduling."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob09aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to schedule"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to plan that something will happen at a particular time "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": " (verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: When I was starting out at WXBJ, I focused on coordinating and scheduling."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob09aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to dabble in "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to do something in a way that is not very serious "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Then, I dabbled in a few things here and there. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob09aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "talent booking "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the process of finding people with a special ability to do something well "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I did talent booking for a while , but I always kept my eyes on the main goal. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le03ob09aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le03ob09re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "With a partner, take turns practicing a mock (not real, but intended to be very similar to a real situation) informational interview. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "Practice asking and answering questions. Remember to use simple past and past continuous."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Refer to the tips about interview etiquette on the last page."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I participate in an informational interview. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "I give descriptions to my partner about professional information."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I talk about what I was doing in the past. "}]}]}